{"type": "message", "id": "a8d203e2-ba59-4f83-afdc-63d1899d5b3e", "parentId": "d89ad5da-88cf-42e3-ae4b-14044644bdbe", "timestamp": "2026-10-23T07:37:35.039Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call437a9d2be12748b88a545632b75d7039", "toolName": "exec", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "---\nname: case-application-drafting\ndescription: 按官方模板撰写或迭代案例申报书、按字数上限填写、按反馈改指定段落（创新点/简介/浓缩合并）、导出word时使用。读模板提框架→材料取数填段→字数校验→定向改段→pandoc导出并报路径；不确定数字标待补充。\n---\n\n# 案例申报书按模板撰写迭代\n\n{SKILL}=本技能根目录。只做文本申报书；配图、图片型PPT走其他路线，不在本路线内。按需读资源，首页即路线。\n\n## 路线（5步）\n\n1. **读模板提框架**：读官方模板与要求原文，填 `templates/framework_and_fill.md`：各节写什么、字数上限、硬指标（如「服务用户≥10万人次」）、佐证材料清单。硬指标与项目数据对一次位，低于门槛的如实提示。换申报口时先重读新要求、重新对位，再动笔。\n2. **提取材料取数**：材料是 docx/pdf 时\n   ```\n   python3 {SKILL}/scripts/extract_texts.py <材料文件或目录> --out <OUT>/extracted\n   python3 {SKILL}/scripts/scan_numeric_refs.py <OUT>/extracted/某材料.txt --out <OUT>/numeric.json\n   ```\n   数值行清单作数字底稿。只用材料与用户确认的数字，用户后说的口径覆盖先前的；没有的数字写「待补充」，并在交付里单列「需要用户补的数字」清单，不编造。\n3. **按框架成文**：逐节填写。用户整段粘贴的文字逐字保留只接入结构；用户指定的叙事主线（如 1.0→2.0 进化）统领全文。\n4. **字数校验**（limits 按当次模板填）：\n   ```\n   python3 {SKILL}/scripts/check_word_counts.py <成文.md> --limits 300,1800,600,300 --out <OUT>/wc.json\n   ```\n   退出0=全达标，1=有节超限（先压超限节再交付），2=输入/用法错。每次改版后重跑。\n5. **导出与回报**：`pandoc 成文.md -o 申报书.docx`（md 必须先过 pandoc；soffice 直转 .md 会保留 Markdown 标记）。确认 docx 存在且非空后，**在同一回复内给出：文件路径 + 字数表 + 待补充清单**。\n\n## 反馈迭代（只动点名的）\n\n- 点名改哪节只改哪节；已确认段落不推翻；用户粘贴的替换文本逐字采用。\n- 上游节改了（如主要做法），派生节（创新点、500字简介）按**最新**内容重新对齐，改完给「与最新内容对照」说明。\n- 浓缩/合并：先给浓缩稿并说明替换去向，用户确认后**写回正式版本文件**。整版重写时新版本另存文件，旧版保留不覆盖。\n- **修改一律写进当前正式版本文件，不留临时文件**：历史教训是把浓缩稿只写进 /tmp，用户追问「你写在哪里了？」。产出位置要主动报，不等追问。\n\n## 资源入口（按需读取）\n\n- `scripts/extract_texts.py`：批量提取 docx/doc/pdf/pptx/md/txt 文本（退出3=有文件失败）\n- `scripts/scan_numeric_refs.py`：数值与图表引用扫描，作数字底稿\n- `scripts/check_word_counts.py`：分节字数校验（用法见步骤4与 `--help`）\n- `templates/framework_and_fill.md`：框架提取＋硬指标对位＋待补充登记表\n- 阶段细节与来源证据：`references/stage_notes.md`\n====\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"申报书分节字数校验：按「一、二、三、…」中文序号分节，统计各节字数并与模板上限比对。\n\n用法（原样可执行）:\n  python3 check_word_counts.py <申报书.md|.txt> --limits 300,1800,600,300 [--sections 一,二,三,四] [--out report.json]\n\n行为:\n- 节标题识别：行首（或行首去除 #/*/空白后）为「一、」「二.」等裸中文序号 + 顿号/点；\n  「（一）」类小节号不匹配，不会拆散大节。第一个标题前的文字计为前言，单独统计。\n- 字数口径：每个中文字符计 1；连续的英文字母/数字串（含 3,162 这类千分位）计 1；\n  空白与 Markdown 语法符（# * > ` | 等）不计。\n- --limits 与 --sections 按位置一一对应；文本中多余节报告 extra，缺节报告 missing。\n- 退出码: 0 全部节均不超上限; 1 有节超上限; 2 输入/用法错误（文件缺失、limits 数目与 sections 不符、找不到任何节标题）。\n- 结果同时打印表格与写入 --out JSON。不联网、不修改输入文件。\n\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport re\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nCN_NUM = \"一二三四五六七八九十\"\nHEADER = re.compile(rf\"^\\s*(?:#+\\s*)?(?:\\*\\s*)*([{CN_NUM}]+)\\s*[、.．]\\s*\")\nTOKEN = re.compile(r\"[A-Za-z0-9]+(?:[,.][A-Za-z0-9]+)*\")\nCJK = re.compile(r\"[\\u4e00-\\u9fff\\u3400-\\u4dbf\\u3007]\")\nMD_NOISE = re.compile(r\"[#*`>_~|\\[\\]]\")\n\n\ndef count_words(text):\n    text = MD_NOISE.sub(\" \", text)\n    cjk = len(CJK.findall(text))\n    tokens = len(TOKEN.findall(text))\n    return cjk + tokens\n\n\ndef split_sections(text):\n    \"\"\"返回 (preamble, {节序号: 节文本})，节文本不含标题行。\"\"\"\n    preamble_lines, sections, current = [], {}, None\n    for line in text.splitlines():\n        m = HEADER.match(line)\n        if m:\n            current = m.group(1)\n            sections.setdefault(current, [])\n            rest = HEADER.sub(\"\", line, count=1).strip()\n            if rest:\n                sections[current].append(rest)\n            continue\n        if current is None:\n            preamble_lines.append(line)\n        else:\n            sections[current].append(line)\n    preamble = \"\\n\".join(preamble_lines)\n    return preamble, {k: \"\\n\".join(v) for k, v in sections.items()}\n\n\ndef main():\n    ap = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=\"申报书分节字数校验\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"input\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--limits\", required=True, help=\"逗号分隔的各节字数上限，如 300,1800,600,300\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--sections\", default=\"一,二,三,四\",\n                    help=\"逗号分隔的节序号，与 limits 按位置对应（默认 一,二,三,四）\")\n    ap.add_argument(\"--out\", help=\"JSON 结果输出路径\")\n    args = ap.parse_args()\n\n    limits = [x.strip() for x in args.limits.split(\",\") if x.strip()]\n    wanted = [x.strip() for x in args.sections.split(\",\") if x.strip()]\n    if not limits or len(limits) != len(wanted):\n        print(\"错误：--limits 数目必须与 --sections 一致且非空\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 2\n    path = Path(args.input)\n    if not path.is_file():\n        print(f\"错误：输入文件不存在 {path}\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 2\n    try:\n        text = path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\n    except OSError as e:\n        print(f\"错误：无法读取 {path}: {e}\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 2\n\n    preamble, sections = split_sections(text)\n    if not sections:\n        print(\"错误：未找到任何「一、」式节标题，无法分节校验\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 2\n\n    report = {\n        \"source\": str(path),\n        \"preamble_chars\": count_words(preamble) if preamble.strip() else 0,\n        \"sections\": [],\n    }\n    over = 0\n    print(f\"{'节':<6}{'字数':>8}{'上限':>8}  状态\")\n    if report[\"preamble_chars\"]:\n        print(f\"{'前言':<6}{report['preamble_chars']:>8}{'-':>8}  不计上限\")\n    for sec, lim in zip(wanted, limits):\n        lim_n = int(lim)\n        if sec not in sections:\n            print(f\"{sec:<6}{'缺失':>8}{lim_n:>8}  missing\")\n            report[\"sections\"].append({\"section\": sec, \"limit\": lim_n, \"status\": \"missing\"})\n            continue\n        n = count_words(sections[sec])\n        status = \"over\" if n > lim_n else \"ok\"\n        over += n > lim_n\n        print(f\"{sec:<6}{n:>8}{lim_n:>8}  {status}\")\n        report[\"sections\"].append({\"section\": sec, \"chars\": n, \"limit\": lim_n, \"status\": status})\n    extra = [s for s in sections if s not in wanted]\n    if extra:\n        print(f\"额外节（未设上限）: {'、'.join(extra)}\")\n        report[\"extra_sections\"] = extra\n    if args.out:\n        Path(args.out).write_text(json.dumps(report, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    return 1 if over else 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.exit(main())\n====\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"扫描已提取的论文文本，产出表/图引用与数值出现清单（供一致性核对与报告引用）。\n\n用法（原样可执行）:\n  python3 scan_numeric_refs.py <提取文本.txt|.md> --out <scan.json>\n\n方法:\n- 逐行扫描，识别 表X(-Y)/Table X、图X(-Y)/Figure X/Fig.X 引用并记录行号；\n- 统计含数值的行数与数值总个数（整数/小数）；\n- 输出 JSON：tables/figures（按引用串排序，mentions 为升序行号）、\n  tables_total、figures_total、numeric_lines、numbers_total、chars。\n- 退出码: 0 成功（静默，结果只写 --out 文件）；2 输入缺失/类型不支持/无法读取。\n不联网、不修改输入文件；不判定一致性结论，结论由审查阶段结合源数据判断。\n\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport re\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nREF_PATTERNS = (\n    (\"table_cn\", re.compile(r\"表\\s?\\d+(?:[-.－]\\d+)?\")),\n    (\"table_en\", re.compile(r\"Table\\s?\\d+\", re.IGNORECASE)),\n    (\"figure_cn\", re.compile(r\"图\\s?\\d+(?:[-.－]\\d+)?\")),\n    (\"figure_en\", re.compile(r\"(?:Figure|Fig\\.?)\\s?\\d+\", re.IGNORECASE)),\n)\nNUMBER = re.compile(r\"\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?\")\nSUPPORTED = {\".txt\", \".md\"}\n\n\ndef scan_text(text):\n    tables, figures = {}, {}\n    numeric_lines = 0\n    numbers_total = 0\n    for lineno, line in enumerate(text.splitlines(), 1):\n        if NUMBER.search(line):\n            numeric_lines += 1\n            numbers_total += len(NUMBER.findall(line))\n        for kind, pattern in REF_PATTERNS:\n            for match in pattern.finditer(line):\n                bucket = tables if kind.startswith(\"table\") else figures\n                entry = bucket.setdefault(match.group(0), {\"kind\": kind, \"mentions\": []})\n                entry[\"mentions\"].append(lineno)\n\n    def as_list(bucket):\n        return [\n            {\"ref\": ref, \"kind\": bucket[ref][\"kind\"], \"mentions\": bucket[ref][\"mentions\"]}\n            for ref in sorted(bucket)\n        ]\n\n    return {\n        \"tables\": as_list(tables),\n        \"figures\": as_list(figures),\n        \"tables_total\": len(tables),\n        \"figures_total\": len(figures),\n        \"numeric_lines\": numeric_lines,\n        \"numbers_total\": numbers_total,\n        \"chars\": len(text),\n    }\n\n\ndef main(argv=None):\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=\"扫描论文文本中的表/图引用与数值\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"input\", help=\"已提取的论文文本（.txt/.md）\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--out\", required=True, help=\"输出 scan.json 路径\")\n    args = parser.parse_args(argv)\n    src = Path(args.input)\n    try:\n        if not src.is_file():\n            raise ValueError(\"input not found: \" + str(src))\n        if src.suffix.lower() not in SUPPORTED:\n            raise ValueError(\"unsupported input type \" + src.suffix + \": expected .txt or .md\")\n        try:\n            text = src.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n        except UnicodeError as error:\n            raise ValueError(\"input is not valid UTF-8 text: \" + str(error))\n    except (OSError, ValueError) as error:\n        print(\"scan_numeric_refs error: \" + str(error), file=sys.stderr)\n        return 2\n    result = scan_text(text)\n    result[\"source\"] = src.name\n    out = Path(args.out)\n    out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    out.write_text(json.dumps(result, ensure_ascii=False, indent=1) + \"\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    raise SystemExit(main())"}], "details": {"persistedDetailsTruncated": true, "originalDetailsBytesAtLeast": 8193, "originalDetailKeys": ["status", "exitCode", "exitSignal", "exitReason", "durationMs", "aggregated", "noOutputTimedOut", "cwd"], "status": "completed", "cwd": "/workspace", "exitCode": 0, "exitSignal": null}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1792741055037, "__openclaw": {"runId": "0cf66f3f-a9d4-4a11-b1b2-ada14f3ce0a4"}}}
